# [HYBRID-VEREMI] Online VeReMi-style physical evidence module.
# This is used only in the hybrid edge server file, not the validated original.
# Modes:
#   shadow  : compute/log p_veremi but keep original p_edge unchanged
#   replace : use p_veremi as the edge evidence score
